<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy policy" slug="privacy" updated="2026-11-25"
  description="What AtlasFigures collects (nothing personal today), how the offline app feature works, and how we will tell you about any change.">
  <p>AtlasFigures does not ask for, collect or store personal information.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>We do not currently use cookies, analytics or advertising trackers. If we add analytics or advertising in future, we will update this page before doing so and explain what is collected and how to opt out.</p>
  <h2>Offline use</h2>
  <p>When you visit, your browser may keep copies of pages you have opened so they still work without a connection, like an app. These copies stay on your device and you can remove them by clearing your browser's site data.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is served by GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may record technical information such as your IP address in its server logs for security and reliability. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>Our fonts are served from our own site, so no font service receives your visit.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy can be raised through our contact page.</p>
</InfoPage>
